      "statement": "`SANDBOX_TYPE` defaults to `langsmith`; the registry lazily imports one of six registered factories (`langsmith`, `daytona`, `modal`, `runloop`, `e2b`, or `local`) and rejects unknown types with a `ValueError` that lists supported types.",
